@startuml
title VOPC - UC-12 Manage Application variables and secrets (design)
left to right direction
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
class "Application Settings UI" as UI <<boundary>>
class "Configuration control" as Config <<control>>
class "Workload reference lookup" as Refs <<control>>
class "Environment-scoped key" as Key <<entity>>
interface "Revision metadata store" as Store
interface "Configuration provider" as Provider
class "Vault KV adapter" as Vault

UI --> Config : add/update/rename/delete
Config --> Refs : affected workloads
Config --> Store : desired/applied revision refs
Config --> Provider : scoped revision read/write
Provider <|.. Vault
Store ..> Key
@enduml
